---
import Verticalgrid from "../assets/Verticalgrid.astro";
---

<section class="relative">
  <Verticalgrid />
  <div class="relative max-w-7xl px-8 md:px-12 lg:px-16 mx-auto py-12 lg:py-24  space-y-24" role="none">
    <div class="mx-auto text-center">
      <div role="subscript">
        <p class="text-sm text-transparent uppercase bg-gradient-to-r from-indigo-300 to-indigo-400 bg-clip-text">
          Complete Marketing Automation for Retailers and eCommerce
        </p>
        <h2 class="mt-8">
          Intelligent Workflows with Effective Results for Shopify 
        </h2>
        <p class="text-xl mt-4">
            Create AI powered workflows for engagement retention and acquisition of users </br>
              Grow your store and drive revenue with loyalty marketing automation.
        </br>
        </p>
      </div>
      <div
        class="relative items-center w-full pb-0 mx-auto mt-12 overflow-hidden max-w-7xl lg:p-10 lg:pb-14 "
        style="">
        <img
          role="img"
          class="object-cover w-full -mb-12  rounded-xl border-white/5 lg:rounded-3xl shadow-vulcan-950"
          src="/assets/homepage/Workflow1.png"
          alt="Workflows for Shopify gift cards and loyalty program"
        />
      </div>
      <ul class="grid grid-cols-1 gap-6 mt-24 lg:text-left sm:grid-cols-3 lg:gap-12"
        role="list">
         <li>
          <div>
            <h3
              role="heading"
              class="text-2xl font-medium text-white lg:text-4xl">
              Integrate
            </h3>
          </div>
          <p role="definition" class="mt-2 text-base">
              Seamlessly integrate your shopify store with top eCommerce platforms and connected apps, offering more personalized workflows. Easily create highly effective experiences at each stage of the customer journey with just a few clicks. highly impactful experiences at every stage of the customer journey — with just a few clicks.
          </p>
        </li>
        <li>
          <div>
            <h3
              role="heading"
              class="text-2xl font-medium text-white lg:text-4xl">
              Automate
            </h3>
          </div>
          <p role="definition" class="mt-2 text-base">
              Develop custom workflows to execute data-driven and sophisticated promotional campaigns. Effortlessly incorporate features such as shopify store credit, coupons, shopify gift cards, and digital wallets into intricate workflows designed to attract, convert, and retain customers.
          </p>
        </li>
        <li>
          <div>
            <h3
              role="heading"
              class="text-2xl font-medium lg:text-4xl text-white">
              Personalize</h3>           
          </div>
          <p role="definition" class="mt-2 text-base">
            Design fully automated, data-driven campaigns that are custom-tailored for your customers. Offer personalized incentives based on each customer's activities and profile, including rewards, cash backs, loyalty points, coupons, gift cards, store credits, and more, to enhance engagement and loyalty.
          </p>
        </li>
       
      </ul>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
